docs {
  Destructive admin actions, kept out of the other folders so that pointing
  `bru run` at the collection cannot ban an account or reset a password by
  accident.

  Every request here targets `{{targetAccountId}}`. Run `Admin / List accounts`
  first and **confirm the id is the account you mean** before sending.
}
